---
import '../styles/flight-story.css';
import { STORY, RELEASE, storyFrame, storyPath } from './flight-story-motion';
const initial = storyFrame(0, .72);
const v = RELEASE.velocity, speed = Math.hypot(v.x, v.y);
---
<section class="flight-story" aria-labelledby="flight-story-title" data-flight-story data-stage="0" data-reboost="electrical">
  <div class="flight-story-inner">
    <div class="flight-story-heading">
      <div><p class="chapter-label">One flight / five moments</p><h2 id="flight-story-title">Follow the handoff.</h2></div>
      <p>Climb to the lower tip. Ride its rotation. Release onto a new path. Choose a moment to follow the payload.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flight-story-frame">
      <div class="flight-story-scene">
        <div class="flight-story-scene-top"><span>EARTH TETHER / CONCEPT VIEW</span><span data-story-timescale>ILLUSTRATION · NOT TO SCALE</span></div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 620" role="img" aria-labelledby="flight-scene-title flight-scene-description">
          <title id="flight-scene-title">An Earth tether flight, from approach to orbital recovery</title>
          <desc id="flight-scene-description" data-story-scene-description>The payload climbs from near Earth to meet the lower tip above the atmosphere.</desc>
          <defs>
            <radialGradient id="story-earth" cx="36%" cy="28%" r="75%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#28546a"/><stop offset=".6" stop-color="#122d3d"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#06131d"/></radialGradient>
            <marker id="story-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7" fill="#efa477"/></marker>
            <marker id="story-thrust-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7" fill="#9fced8"/></marker>
            <clipPath id="story-earth-clip"><circle cx={STORY.earth.x} cy={STORY.earth.y} r={STORY.radius}/></clipPath>
          </defs>
          <g data-story-world>
          <g class="story-stars" fill="#c8d7dd"><circle cx="70" cy="87" r="1"/><circle cx="157" cy="180" r="1.4"/><circle cx="246" cy="91" r="1"/><circle cx="645" cy="90" r="1"/><circle cx="786" cy="147" r="1.4"/><circle cx="889" cy="76" r="1"/><circle cx="933" cy="262" r="1.2"/></g>
          <circle cx={STORY.earth.x} cy={STORY.earth.y} r={STORY.orbit} class="story-operating-orbit"/>
          <g data-story-recovery-orbits opacity="0">
            <circle cx={STORY.earth.x} cy={STORY.earth.y} r={STORY.recoveryOrbit} fill="none" stroke="#c48e72" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 9"/>
            <path d="M88 220L173 239M88 326L156 294" fill="none" stroke="#829da9"/>
            <text x="52" y="200" class="story-map-label">OPERATING ORBIT</text>
            <text x="52" y="351" class="story-map-label">AFTER TRANSFER</text>
          </g>
          <circle data-story-atmosphere cx={STORY.earth.x} cy={STORY.earth.y} r={STORY.atmosphere} fill="none" stroke="#8fbacb" stroke-opacity=".18" stroke-width="12"/>
          <circle data-story-earth cx={STORY.earth.x} cy={STORY.earth.y} r={STORY.radius} fill="url(#story-earth)" stroke="#618497" stroke-width="2"/>
          <g clip-path="url(#story-earth-clip)" fill="none" stroke="#4d7790" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".34"><path d="M90 570c90-51 167-32 250-6 87 27 163 4 232-35M125 492c68 40 130 31 210 12 82-19 128-9 192 28"/></g>
          <text x="280" y="563" class="story-map-label">EARTH</text>
          <path data-story-path d={storyPath(0)} fill="none" stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="3 7" opacity=".8"/>
          <g data-story-pickup><path d="M362 355H434" fill="none" stroke="#9eb6bf"/><text x="445" y="361" class="story-map-label">PICKUP ABOVE EARTH</text></g>
          <g data-story-tether transform={`translate(${initial.hub.x} ${initial.hub.y}) rotate(${initial.angle * 180 / Math.PI})`}>
            <line x1="0" y1={-STORY.arm} x2="0" y2={STORY.arm} stroke="#e9eff1" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <line x1="0" y1={-STORY.arm} x2="0" y2={STORY.arm} stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="1" opacity=".75"/>
            <circle cy={-STORY.arm} r="7" fill="#dce9ed"/><circle cy={STORY.arm} r="7" fill="#dce9ed"/>
            <g data-story-conductor opacity="0">
              <line x1="0" y1={-STORY.arm} x2="0" y2={STORY.arm} stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="4"/>
              <g data-story-current fill="#fff0d8">{Array.from({length: 8}, () => <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="3.5"/>)}</g>
              <g fill="#234854" stroke="#9fced8" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="-43" y="-17" width="25" height="34"/><rect x="18" y="-17" width="25" height="34"/><path d="M-31 -17V17M31 -17V17M-43 0H-18M18 0H43"/></g>
            </g>
            <rect x="-9" y="-9" width="18" height="18" rx="3" fill="#15222b" stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="2"/>
          </g>
          <g data-story-payload transform={`translate(${initial.payload!.x} ${initial.payload!.y})`}><circle r="9" fill="#efa477"/><circle r="3" fill="#28170f"/></g>
          <g data-story-capture opacity="0">
            <rect x="-3" y="-20" width="6" height="10" fill="#091116"/>
            <g fill="#1b2b34" stroke="#dce9ed" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M-8 15L-11 21V32L-6 36H6L11 32V21L8 15Z" fill="#263945"/>
              <path d="M-4 9V15H4V9M-7 23H7M-7 29H7"/>
              <rect x="-17" y="-23" width="34" height="7" rx="2"/>
            </g>
            <circle r="10.5" fill="none" stroke="#f6ba92" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="#dce9ed" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path data-story-jaw="left" d="M0 0L-3 13L0 27L9 31" transform="translate(-14 -18) rotate(36)"/>
              <path data-story-jaw="right" d="M0 0L3 13L0 27L-9 31" transform="translate(14 -18) rotate(-36)"/>
            </g>
            <circle cx="-14" cy="-18" r="2.7" fill="#efa477"/><circle cx="14" cy="-18" r="2.7" fill="#efa477"/>
            <path data-story-latch d="M-5 13H5" fill="none" stroke="#9fced8" stroke-width="3" opacity="0"/>
          </g>
          <g data-story-velocity opacity="0">
            <line x1={RELEASE.tip.x} y1={RELEASE.tip.y} x2={RELEASE.tip.x + v.x / speed * 120} y2={RELEASE.tip.y + v.y / speed * 120} stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#story-arrow)"/>
            <text x={RELEASE.tip.x + 14} y={RELEASE.tip.y - 47} class="story-map-label">VELOCITY AT RELEASE</text>
          </g>
          <g data-story-recovery opacity="0">
            <g data-story-engine opacity="0">
              <path data-story-exhaust d="M-28 -10Q-63 -16 -100 0Q-63 16 -28 10Z" fill="#efa477" opacity=".7"/>
              <path d="M-8 -5L-28 -12V12L-8 5Z" fill="#253742" stroke="#dce9ed" stroke-width="2"/>
              <circle r="8" fill="#15222b" stroke="#efa477" stroke-width="2"/>
            </g>
            <line data-story-thrust x1="0" y1="0" x2="130" y2="0" stroke="#9fced8" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#story-thrust-arrow)"/>
          </g>
          <g data-story-recovery-key opacity="0">
            <text x="665" y="300" class="story-map-label" data-story-drive-label>CURRENT IN TETHER</text>
            <text x="665" y="330" class="story-map-label" data-story-force-label>MAGNETIC FORCE</text>
            <text x="665" y="360" class="story-map-label" data-story-drive-note>CONTROLLED WITH SPIN</text>
          </g>
          </g>
          <g data-story-closeup-labels opacity="0" class="story-capture-labels">
            <text x="58" y="62">TIP CAMERA / CAPTURE DETAIL</text>
            <text x="680" y="190">CONCEPTUAL GRAPPLE</text>
            <text x="680" y="230" data-story-capture-status>Match motion</text>
            <path d="M680 246H885" stroke="#42525a"/>
            <text x="680" y="274">Align · close · secure</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <p class="flight-story-explanation" data-story-explanation>Climb from Earth → meet the lower tip</p>
        <div class="flight-story-scrubber" hidden data-story-scrubber><label for="flight-story-progress">Explore this moment</label><input id="flight-story-progress" data-story-progress type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="1" value="0" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flight-story-side">
        <div class="flight-story-copy" id="flight-story-copy">
          <p class="flight-story-step-number" data-story-number>01 / APPROACH</p>
          <h3 data-story-title>Climb to the meeting point.</h3>
          <p data-story-description>The vehicle approaches from below, gaining altitude until it meets the lower tip. At pickup, its position and velocity must closely match the tip. The tip is moving with the orbit, slowed by the tether’s opposing rotation.</p>
          <div class="flight-story-readout"><span data-story-value>100 km</span><small data-story-readout>Pickup altitude in the reference comparison</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flight-story-controls">
          <div class="flight-story-reboost" data-story-reboost hidden role="group" aria-label="Reboost method">
            <span>Reboost method</span>
            <div><button type="button" data-story-method="electrical" aria-pressed="true">Electrodynamic</button><button type="button" data-story-method="chemical" aria-pressed="false">Chemical rocket</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flight-story-step-list" aria-label="Flight moments">
            <button type="button" data-story-step="0" aria-current="step" disabled><span>01</span>Approach</button>
            <button type="button" data-story-step="1" disabled><span>02</span>Capture</button>
            <button type="button" data-story-step="2" disabled><span>03</span>Swing</button>
            <button type="button" data-story-step="3" disabled><span>04</span>Release</button>
            <button type="button" data-story-step="4" disabled><span>05</span>Recover</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="flight-story-motion" data-story-motion hidden>Pause animation</button>
          <noscript><p class="flight-story-nojs">The full sequence is explained in the sections below.</p></noscript>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flight-story-foot">
      <p>Geometry, clearances and time are illustrative. The 100 km pickup and 4.1 km/s tip speed are <a href="/reference-architecture/">reference comparison values</a>. A real release depends on the desired destination and the loaded tether’s motion.</p>
      <a href="/lab/">Explore a flight in the Tether Lab ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  import './flight-story';
</script>
